Mutant for the provider-account journey (web/e2e/provider-accounts-journey.spec.ts).

The unresolved-adoption notice dismisses its own intent as soon as its reconciliation
read is refused (403). A console with this defect loses an unresolved adoption while the
engine refuses the account read, within one authority boundary. The journey's step for
profile D must then fail at an assertion that requires that notice. Applied by the
provider accounts qualification workflow; never committed to product source.

